# Auto-detect text files and normalize line endings to LF in the repo, checked out as CRLF on
# Windows (matching every contributor's own local git core.autocrlf=true default) — avoids the
# "warning: LF will be replaced by CRLF" noise every commit in this repo has shown so far, and
# keeps diffs clean regardless of which OS someone clones on.
* text=auto eol=crlf

# Never touch line endings in binary files.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.dll binary
*.pdb binary
